        "2",
        "3",
        "4",
        "5"
      ],
      "choicesSha256": "sha256:3cc19e370a6671b60f17396fd032ed6593aa1547f8af80d6ab8d949018911b5e",
      "contentChecked": true,
      "choicesChecked": true,
      "answerOrSolutionViewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "sourceQuestionNo": "6",
      "displayNo": "6",
      "sourcePageNo": 2,
      "sourceIdentityKey": "sha256:d8cfc9ae74b38e1fd2ead13d054b39a0802fb217581c127e6e394817888a1ac1|6",
      "sourceDocumentSha256": "sha256:d8cfc9ae74b38e1fd2ead13d054b39a0802fb217581c127e6e394817888a1ac1",
      "sourceEvidencePath": "archive-work/new-imports/2026-2mid-prompt-assets/26_매산고_2학기_중간_고1_기출/source/page_p002.jpg",
      "sourceEvidenceSha256": "sha256:d6f128987233f69312b6f978776deeae57f10906ade4ea6e71b19dd111134bbb",
      "sourceText": "좌표평면 위의 세 점 $A(-3,1)$, $B(2,-4)$, $C(4,k)$에 대하여 삼각형 $ABC$의 무게중심 $G$가 $x$축 위에 있을 때, 상수 $k$의 값은? [4.1점]",
      "sourceTextSha256": "sha256:3eea18f041a158a2c6f83d34e0f724a0999fc2c6e96327469e2369672825c5f8",
