    {
      "id": 7,
      "sourceQuestionNo": "7",
      "displayNo": "7",
      "sourcePageNo": 2,
      "sourceIdentityKey": "sha256:d8cfc9ae74b38e1fd2ead13d054b39a0802fb217581c127e6e394817888a1ac1|7",
      "sourceDocumentSha256": "sha256:d8cfc9ae74b38e1fd2ead13d054b39a0802fb217581c127e6e394817888a1ac1",
      "sourceEvidencePath": "archive-work/new-imports/2026-2mid-prompt-assets/26_매산고_2학기_중간_고1_기출/source/page_p002.jpg",
      "sourceEvidenceSha256": "sha256:d6f128987233f69312b6f978776deeae57f10906ade4ea6e71b19dd111134bbb",
      "sourceText": "다음 중 방정식 $x^2+y^2+4x-2y+k+1=0$이 원을 나타내도록 하는 실수 $k$값이 아닌 것은? [4.3점]",
