        "1",
        "2",
        "3",
        "4"
      ],
      "choicesSha256": "sha256:51247bbaa5b4e54f213e8c8d62896eb320bf4bafb4c503e7c09d7302db3ceb61",
      "contentChecked": true,
      "choicesChecked": true,
      "answerOrSolutionViewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "sourceQuestionNo": "8",
      "displayNo": "8",
      "sourcePageNo": 2,
      "sourceIdentityKey": "sha256:d8cfc9ae74b38e1fd2ead13d054b39a0802fb217581c127e6e394817888a1ac1|8",
      "sourceDocumentSha256": "sha256:d8cfc9ae74b38e1fd2ead13d054b39a0802fb217581c127e6e394817888a1ac1",
      "sourceEvidencePath": "archive-work/new-imports/2026-2mid-prompt-assets/26_매산고_2학기_중간_고1_기출/source/page_p002.jpg",
      "sourceEvidenceSha256": "sha256:d6f128987233f69312b6f978776deeae57f10906ade4ea6e71b19dd111134bbb",
      "sourceText": "이차함수 $y=x^2-1$ 위의 점 $(1,0)$에서의 접선 $l$과 평행하고 점 $(2,3)$을 지나는 직선의 방정식이 $ax+y+b=0$이다. 상수 $a$, $b$에 대하여 $a+b$의 값은? [4.4점]",
      "sourceTextSha256": "sha256:2e0092687cd3c32fe15335dc3eed87787634f29dc7d04dd96f99429880afa2f1",
      "choices": [
        "$-1$",
        "0",
        "1",
        "2",
        "3"
      ],
      "choicesSha256": "sha256:92d0408e83242f628b902ed389c58e1d4be3ab9fe4fde9986def2821dcf31539",
      "contentChecked": true,
      "choicesChecked": true,
      "answerOrSolutionViewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "sourceQuestionNo": "9",
      "displayNo": "9",
      "sourcePageNo": 3,
      "sourceIdentityKey": "sha256:d8cfc9ae74b38e1fd2ead13d054b39a0802fb217581c127e6e394817888a1ac1|9",
      "sourceDocumentSha256": "sha256:d8cfc9ae74b38e1fd2ead13d054b39a0802fb217581c127e6e394817888a1ac1",
      "sourceEvidencePath": "archive-work/new-imports/2026-2mid-prompt-assets/26_매산고_2학기_중간_고1_기출/source/page_p003.jpg",
      "sourceEvidenceSha256": "sha256:2777f0e88cc9ba760232dd16b7a3e6ab5b4c8e955ad868f590a0376812f2b503",
      "sourceText": "평행이동 $(x,y)\\to(x+k,y-2)$에 의하여 원 $x^2+y^2+2x-6y-15=0$이 옮겨지는 원이 직선 $2x-3y+6=0$과 접하도록 하는 모든 상수 $k$값의 합은? [4.5점]",
      "sourceTextSha256": "sha256:ce7e2838f792c22ebe095f5fedc876916a87437694e88e9f1e3307fe1238bf31",
      "choices": [
        "$-4$",
        "$-3$",
        "$-2$",
        "$-1$",
        "0"
      ],
      "choicesSha256": "sha256:9ceb6c3d5641474b8440d567a73857f5f3761a6c450bb11e9a89aa3831a57317",
      "contentChecked": true,
      "choicesChecked": true,
      "answerOrSolutionViewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "sourceQuestionNo": "10",
      "displayNo": "10",
      "sourcePageNo": 3,
      "sourceIdentityKey": "sha256:d8cfc9ae74b38e1fd2ead13d054b39a0802fb217581c127e6e394817888a1ac1|10",
      "sourceDocumentSha256": "sha256:d8cfc9ae74b38e1fd2ead13d054b39a0802fb217581c127e6e394817888a1ac1",
      "sourceEvidencePath": "archive-work/new-imports/2026-2mid-prompt-assets/26_매산고_2학기_중간_고1_기출/source/page_p003.jpg",
      "sourceEvidenceSha256": "sha256:2777f0e88cc9ba760232dd16b7a3e6ab5b4c8e955ad868f590a0376812f2b503",
      "sourceText": "두 직선 $y=0$, $y=\\dfrac{4}{3}x$가 이루는 각 중 작은 각을 이등분하는 직선의 방정식을 $y=mx$라 할 때, 상수 $m$의 값은? [4.6점]",
      "sourceTextSha256": "sha256:c5665f02c246cb07426e34edf82a97de172cc8bf6e765a8e2a348f77d162318f",
      "choices": [
        "$-1$",
        "$-\\dfrac{1}{2}$",
        "0",
        "$\\dfrac{1}{2}$",
        "1"
      ],
      "choicesSha256": "sha256:d6f7b8821e24db9065f7d669b162806609445d00a5befa4e986270d0cb611303",
      "contentChecked": true,
      "choicesChecked": true,
      "answerOrSolutionViewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "sourceQuestionNo": "11",
      "displayNo": "11",
      "sourcePageNo": 3,
      "sourceIdentityKey": "sha256:d8cfc9ae74b38e1fd2ead13d054b39a0802fb217581c127e6e394817888a1ac1|11",
      "sourceDocumentSha256": "sha256:d8cfc9ae74b38e1fd2ead13d054b39a0802fb217581c127e6e394817888a1ac1",
      "sourceEvidencePath": "archive-work/new-imports/2026-2mid-prompt-assets/26_매산고_2학기_중간_고1_기출/source/page_p003.jpg",
      "sourceEvidenceSha256": "sha256:2777f0e88cc9ba760232dd16b7a3e6ab5b4c8e955ad868f590a0376812f2b503",
      "sourceText": "좌표평면 위의 두 점 $A(-1,4)$, $B(4,a)$에 대하여 선분 $AB$와 점 $P$에서 만나는 직선 $l:2x+y-17=0$이 있다. 점 $A$, $B$에서 직선 $l$에 내린 두 수선의 발을 각각 $A\\prime$, $B\\prime$라 할 때, $\\overline{AA\\prime}:\\overline{BB\\prime}=3:2$를 만족시키는 양수 $a$의 값은? [4.7점]",
      "sourceTextSha256": "sha256:03328b24655c4f37d74be3fefecb599ee46870282488a199688777c4c288d2be",
      "choices": [
        "17",
        "18",
        "19",
        "20",
        "21"
      ],
      "choicesSha256": "sha256:baae6bfccef203671128a1b840bc56bdc8bb3f5eb5cb3f702dfc24d4cb864daf",
      "contentChecked": true,
      "choicesChecked": true,
      "answerOrSolutionViewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "sourceQuestionNo": "12",
      "displayNo": "12",
      "sourcePageNo": 3,
      "sourceIdentityKey": "sha256:d8cfc9ae74b38e1fd2ead13d054b39a0802fb217581c127e6e394817888a1ac1|12",
      "sourceDocumentSha256": "sha256:d8cfc9ae74b38e1fd2ead13d054b39a0802fb217581c127e6e394817888a1ac1",
      "sourceEvidencePath": "archive-work/new-imports/2026-2mid-prompt-assets/26_매산고_2학기_중간_고1_기출/source/page_p003.jpg",
      "sourceEvidenceSha256": "sha256:2777f0e88cc9ba760232dd16b7a3e6ab5b4c8e955ad868f590a0376812f2b503",
      "sourceText": "그림과 같이 좌표평면 위에 원 $C:(x-8)^2+(y-4)^2=1$과 점 $A(2,0)$이 있다. 원 $C$ 위의 점 $P$와 직선 $y=x$ 위의 점 $Q$에 대하여 $\\overline{AQ}+\\overline{QP}$의 최솟값은? [4.7점]",
      "sourceTextSha256": "sha256:6a3290d5fd100533330399141cf7630f4a80fead6d889aa64e5f67f605fad7f3",
      "choices": [
        "$2\\sqrt{17}-2$",
        "$2\\sqrt{17}-1$",
        "$2\\sqrt{17}$",
        "$\\sqrt{17}-2$",
        "$\\sqrt{17}-1$"
      ],
      "choicesSha256": "sha256:6fb51101641f2117f3ff7fdc52d24ff39c46447a2638d17e9347f5f8cc015f89",
      "contentChecked": true,
      "choicesChecked": true,
      "answerOrSolutionViewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "sourceQuestionNo": "13",
      "displayNo": "13",
      "sourcePageNo": 4,
      "sourceIdentityKey": "sha256:d8cfc9ae74b38e1fd2ead13d054b39a0802fb217581c127e6e394817888a1ac1|13",
      "sourceDocumentSha256": "sha256:d8cfc9ae74b38e1fd2ead13d054b39a0802fb217581c127e6e394817888a1ac1",
      "sourceEvidencePath": "archive-work/new-imports/2026-2mid-prompt-assets/26_매산고_2학기_중간_고1_기출/source/page_p004.jpg",
      "sourceEvidenceSha256": "sha256:dd86d3b44e6977feb7df53e88aa05182da25388347c480dd896fa4d730838049",
      "sourceText": "전체집합 $U$의 공집합이 아닌 부분집합 $A$, $B$에 대하여 $S(A,B)=(A\\cap B^C)\\cup(A\\cup B^C)^C$라 할 때, 다음 중 <보기>에서 옳은 것만을 있는 대로 고른 것은? [4.8점] <보기> ㄱ. $n(S(A,B))=n(A\\cup B)$이면 $n(A\\cap B)=0$이다. ㄴ. $S(A,B)=A^C$이면 $A\\cup B=U$이다. ㄷ. $S(A,B)\\cap C^C=S(A\\cap B,B\\cap C)$이다.",
      "sourceTextSha256": "sha256:ef8dbf1af892612591b152151b7610c5b0f6503eef20538c114f51e6dba8f6b3",
      "choices": [
        "ㄱ",
        "ㄱ, ㄴ",
        "ㄱ, ㄷ",
        "ㄴ, ㄷ",
        "ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ"
      ],
      "choicesSha256": "sha256:cbb51efd34b277f98bee5b51e4e93e2ccd28d033c32715f81f8ef790586831ca",
      "contentChecked": true,
      "choicesChecked": true,
      "answerOrSolutionViewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "sourceQuestionNo": "14",
      "displayNo": "14",
      "sourcePageNo": 4,
      "sourceIdentityKey": "sha256:d8cfc9ae74b38e1fd2ead13d054b39a0802fb217581c127e6e394817888a1ac1|14",
      "sourceDocumentSha256": "sha256:d8cfc9ae74b38e1fd2ead13d054b39a0802fb217581c127e6e394817888a1ac1",
